tress management and mental relaxation anytime, at your own pace.\n\u2022 Extensive Scenario Library: Safely explore 3D environments for professional, academic, social and daily life scenarios, as well as social anxiety, specific phobias and stress management.\n\u2022 Flexible Use: Access all content on your phone screen or through a VR headset for a deeper experience.\n\nNote: VR-Social is designed for both individual use and expert-guided programs. A personal access code is required to log in to the application.\n\nContact Us: info@vrsocial.com.tr\nWebsite: vrsocial.com.tr\n", "short_description": "360\u00b0 virtual reality experience for stress management and real-life scenarios"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vr-social-privacy-policy/ana-sayfa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Metaverse Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrsocial.com.tr/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25047437078227325"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831964_4295785577337661_7245390819449195147_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8qweGuszPDUQ7kNvwFxeIip&_nc_oc=AdpV3TsCf50gHdX4XuHtkjig9P7Fj47FuXku6mrz